ect answer is \"$R$ and $C$ only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186055412 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "abc6b3ee-0251-5c9c-9358-bd192c434dd1" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Elements Belonging to Scripted Special Sets"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a0ad2a92-8d40-5f7a-8756-6c96233a3978" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186054145} {:answer/id #uuid "479be8db-0d15-5456-8974-cd4bff0c9d2a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II and III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186054146} {:answer/id #uuid "5cc5289e-fa19-569e-83de-eafc384b50d8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I, III, and IV only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186054147} {:answer/id #uuid "70a054de-04f0-5a9d-a470-441fad23a71b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I and IV only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186054148} {:answer/id #uuid "780ff313-8a9b-5be2-b65f-faa4c630fe2c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I and II only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186054149}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5cc5289e-fa19-569e-83de-eafc384b50d8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I, III, and IV only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186054147} :answer-field/id #uuid "fe477ecb-727e-521c-b8ee-7424438e8603" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186054144}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "c2a941ac-46f5-56a9-b5ba-03889446453a" :question/math-academy-id "q-80336" :question/problem "Which of the numbers below belong to  ${R}_{0}^{-}?$\n\n- $-\\pi $\n- $\\sqrt{3}$\n- $-\\frac{4}{5}$\n- $0$" :question/worked-solution "Remember that ${R}_{0}^{-}$ is the set of all negative real numbers and $0.$\n\n- $-\\pi $ belongs to ${R}_{0}^{-}.\\,✓$\n\n- $\\sqrt{3}$ is a positive number, so it does *not* 